The design, the gate discipline (stable rule ids, both-polarity fixtures asserted by message,
a local runner held to CI, empty corpora reported rather than passed) and several tools are
adapted from agentic-gatekeeper, a project by the same author (not public; GPL-3.0-or-later).

The reference guidance is the deck "What Good Looks Like for Post-Incident Reviews"
(Mike Gigante, 2025). The worked example under examples/ is fictional: the organisation,
services, numbers and people are invented.
